  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1404.01 Standard Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1404.01 Standard Required.\n\n(a) All carnival or amusement rides, except as set forth in (d) below, shall be maintained in the manner prescribed by the manufacturer of the carnival or amusement ride.\n\n(b) If the manufacturer’s instructions for maintenance are not available, the carnival or amusement ride shall be maintained in a manner which will prevent the carnival or amusement ride from being hazardous to any user, operator, or spectator.\n\n(c) The responsibility for proper maintenance shall rest with the owner or operator.\n\n(d) Maintenance of challenge courses or zip lines shall conform to the standards set forth in either the “ANSI/ACCT 03-2019 CHALLENGE COURSES AND CANOPY/ZIP LINE TOURS STANDARDS” (Revision of ANSI/ACCT 03-2016 Standards), or the ASTM International standards listed in Saf-C 1402.01(a), available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #2229, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2950, eff 1-3-85; ss by #4531, eff 1-1-89; ss by #5940, INTERIM, eff 1-1-95; ss by #5952, eff 1-24-95, EXPIRED: 1-24-03\n\nNew. #7833, INTERIM, eff 2-22-03, EXPIRED: 8-21-03\n\nNew. #8045, eff 2-20-04; ss by #8342, eff 4-28-05, EXPIRED: 1-2-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)\n\nNew. #10507, eff 1-21-14; ss by #12615, eff 8-28-18; ss by #13666, eff 6-20-23; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
